# Trivy container-image scan ignore file (ADR-008 §9).
#
# RULES (enforced by review; this file is CODEOWNERS-guarded):
#   * Time-boxed entries ONLY. Every line MUST end with `# review-by:YYYY-MM-DD`.
#   * Every entry MUST state why the CVE does not apply / a linked issue.
#   * No permanent entries. A real HIGH/CRITICAL is fixed or explicitly,
#     reviewably suppressed here.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-XXXX-XXXXX # base-image only, not reachable from our code, #123 # review-by:2026-12-31
